Package: burnitnow
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CD/DVD burning frontend for V\OS
 BurnItNow is a graphical frontend for the cdrecord, readcd and mkisofs
 command line tools: audio and data compilations, disc cloning and
 on-the-fly copying, with a localized interface.
